@startuml
title Figure 14: Step 3 sequence diagram for a resource order

participant "Product Order\nCapture & Validation\nManagement" as POCV
participant "Product Inventory" as PI
participant "Product Order\nDelivery & Orchestration\nManagement" as PODOM
participant "Service Inventory" as SI #blue
participant "Service Order\nManagement" as SOM #blue
participant "Event Management" as Event #grey
participant "Resource Order\nManagement" as ROM #blue

== Step 3 (For each resource order) ==

group run through ResourceOrder orchestration

    ROM -> Event : 1 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="inProgress")
    activate Event
    Event -> SOM : 2 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="inProgress")
    deactivate Event

    note right of ROM : Resource order item\nspecific steps (figures in 15 and 17)

    ROM -> Event : 3 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="completed")
    activate Event
    Event -> SOM : 4 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/resourceOrderStateChange\n(resourceOrderItemState="completed")
    deactivate Event

end

SOM -> SOM : 5 update CFSOrderItem (state="completed")

SOM -> SI : 6 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nPATCH /service\n(state="active")
activate SI
SI --> SOM : 7 **TMF638** 200 OK (RFS)

SOM -> SI : 8 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nPATCH /service\n(state="active")
SI --> SOM : 9 **TMF638** 200 OK (CFS)
deactivate SI

SOM -> Event : 10 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="completed")
activate Event
Event -> PODOM : 11 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/serviceOrderStateChange\n(serviceOrderItemState="completed")
deactivate Event

PODOM -> Event : 12 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event productOrderStateChange\n(productOrderState="completed")
activate Event
Event -> POCV : 13 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST listener/productOrderStateChange\n(productOrderState="completed")
deactivate Event

PODOM -> PI : 14 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management**\nPATCH /product\n(product-specification-level order item\nstate="Active")
activate PI
deactivate PI

@enduml
